      {
        "id": 147281,
        "name": "YouLostMe",
        "username": "YouLostMe",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/54ee81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-24T22:58:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Visionary and The Dreamer don't have much, but they have one little thing I like: Vis comes the closest of the heroes (I think) to having two cards where one is flat superior to the other.&nbsp;Psychic Maelstrom is almost always going to be better than Cerebral Hemorrhage… Except, for example, against the Dreamer.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is a really cool interaction, and something I never thought of before.</p>",
